@1 = ~Ironstone Pebble Collection: every ioun stone can be put in orbit~
@2 = ~This mod needs an Enhanced Edition game (BG:EE, BG2:EE, EET or IWD:EE).~
@3 = ~Eldritch Magic Reborn's own ioun stone component is installed; the two would fight over the same stones. Uninstall that component first.~
@10 = ~Orbit: While worn, use this stone's "Put in Orbit" item ability to set it circling your head. It leaves the head slot and your inventory but keeps working, and any number of stones can orbit at once. Use the "Recall" special ability to take it back.~
@11 = ~Recall~
@12 = ~Returns this ioun stone from orbit to your inventory and ends its benefits.~
@20 = ~Ironstone Pebble Collection: ioun stones made orbit-capable:~
@30 = ~Ironstone Pebble Collection: orbit visuals for ioun stones that have none~
@31 = ~Ironstone Pebble Collection: orbit visuals added (stone -> colour):~
@13 = ~This cursed stone returns to the head. Empty the head slot first.~
